already added'; and (3) a test for the max-tags announcement that sets
TagInputWrapper to its maxTags state, attempts to add another tag, and asserts
the live region reports 'Cannot add more than X tags'. Ensure all new tests
reuse the same live region lookup (role 'status', hidden: true) and follow the
existing fireEvent patterns.
```

